{"steam_appid":1099410,"steam_name":"A Total War Saga: TROY","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1099410/386375/13fd35095912bc7fda0fae04c777822b5200634a/1750619311/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1638374032","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256843678/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1638374032","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/ss_16ee38bc88ec0db58b534343c88eefb8b8c31880.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763642600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/ss_2063ab37899aed64e5b21d631e04a372f9840f8b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763642600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/ss_fad0c3027b9444b86371619cacda50a6e73aea2e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763642600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/ss_f7e905a7f2039fcbc7d10a54e05dbfb110903931.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763642600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/ss_20f398207962b5c8c5a803ba7ef2d20c48fbafb0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763642600"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/21f8e24e17ecf6092fec5f38634baa12.poster.avif?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/21f8e24e17ecf6092fec5f38634baa12.webm?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/21f8e24e17ecf6092fec5f38634baa12.mp4?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/ef54e0111f5a1de4120de4d04acd85cf.avif?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>In this legendary age, heroes walk the earth. In an act that shocks the world, audacious Paris, prince of Troy, elopes with the beautiful queen of Sparta. As they sail away, King Menelaus curses her name. He vows to bring his wife home – whatever the cost. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/92439c240ab1d11f1eeffb35bf929ddc.webp?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=51 /></span><br>Fight to save or conquer the kingdom of Troy as one of eight iconic heroes, including the infamous warrior Achilles, noble protector Hector, wayward prince Paris and vengeful king Menelaus. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/723637573ab6dde424b6aab4a3111941.poster.avif?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/723637573ab6dde424b6aab4a3111941.webm?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/723637573ab6dde424b6aab4a3111941.mp4?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/bb353e745ca96a7192968f6c86f2b0e8.webp?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=51 /></span><br>Lead an army across the fabled lands of the Aegean, recruit special units inspired by creatures of Greek myth, and charge into battle against ferocious foes. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/4441e6cdf4c7bbcf27089b24434bb823.poster.avif?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/4441e6cdf4c7bbcf27089b24434bb823.webm?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/4441e6cdf4c7bbcf27089b24434bb823.mp4?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/3893eeba49fc928b00aaf2f8dece397b.webp?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=51 /></span><br>Build your empire through strategy, statecraft, diplomacy and all-out war, as you conquer this vast and striking recreation of the Bronze Age Mediterranean.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/dbb4da5cd5371112af0d42871b896c99.poster.avif?t=1763642600\" width=616 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/dbb4da5cd5371112af0d42871b896c99.webm?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099410/extras/dbb4da5cd5371112af0d42871b896c99.mp4?t=1763642600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo 3.0 GHz/Intel i7 8550U 1.80GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 460 1GB/AMD Radeon HD 5770 1 GB/Intel UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 26 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Microsoft no longer supports Windows 10 or older versions.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/